  "description": "Leopard Properties is delighted to present Apartment 13, Newtown Court, an exceptional first-floor, two-bedroom apartment situated in a highly sought-after, mature residential development just off Orwell Road in Dublin 14. \n\nTucked away in a peaceful and private complex, this spacious property offers the perfect balance of quiet suburban living with effortless city access.\n\nFlooded with natural light, the apartment is thoughtfully laid out with bright and independent living areas:\n\n• Spacious Living Room: A large, welcoming living and dining area perfect for relaxing or entertaining guests.\n\n• Separate Kitchen: A fully fitted kitchen equipped with ample storage and modern appliances.\n\n• Two Double Bedrooms: Two generously sized double bedrooms featuring excellent wardrobe space.\n\n• Separate Bathroom: A full independent bathroom complete with a fitted bath.\n\n• Outdoor Space & Parking: Tenants will enjoy access to beautifully maintained, expansive communal green garden, along with ample hassle-free off-street parking.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Prime Location: Nestled in a quiet, mature residential setting off Eaton Brae / Orwell Road.\n\n• Transport Links: An easy walk to the Windy Arbour LUAS stop, offering rapid access straight into St. Stephen’s Green and the wider city centre.\n\n• Local Amenities: Within easy reach of the vibrant villages of Rathgar, Churchtown, and Dundrum, featuring premium local shopping, cafes, and restaurants, as well as the Dundrum Town Centre.\n\n• Nature on Your Doorstep: Excellent leisure options nearby, including a scenic walking route along the Dodder Linear Park connecting Bushy, Orwell, and Dartry Parks.\n\n• Immediate Move-In: Ready for immediate occupation on a secure, long-term lease.\n\nViewing Enquiries\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate this unique property. Email enquiries only. Please click the link to reply through Leopard Properties directly via Leopard Properties website to arrange a viewing time.\nWalk through video available on Leopard Properties Instagram. \n",
